's private rooms.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">How is a farmhouse interior designer different from a city-home designer?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Farmhouses have larger spaces, outdoor areas and heavy seasonal use, so materials, storage and lighting are planned differently from a city apartment.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>A Farmhouse You Will Want to Visit Every Weekend</h2>\n            <p>A good farmhouse feels relaxed on a quiet Sunday but still works when two hundred guests arrive. The right farmhouse interior designer plans for both.</p><p>Live in Hauz Khas and own a farmhouse near Delhi? <a href=\"/hauzkhas/contact\">Contact 9th Corner</a> to plan a visit to the property.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}